  "notes": "The passenger scheme (standard.json) with 'Cargo' added after the title and the title enlarged and moved aft (freighters have no forward windows to sit over). Measured on 777F B-16790 (left, 2026). No Star Alliance badge was seen on the freighters. On the right side 'Cargo' is hidden behind the engine in the one photo; it is assumed to be there too. Title positions from oblique photos (±0.03). Re-checked 2026-11-15: the sweep and the pinstripe and belly lines as on the standard (curves); the 'Cargo' lowercase measured at 0.75 of its capital on B-16790.",
  "history": "Added with the cargo divisions (2026-11-13). EVA's 777Fs have flown this since the first delivery (2016)."
